# Knowledge Graph

Interactive visualization of the gastronomic knowledge graph showing connections between recipes, ingredients, and regions.

<GraphExplorer />

## About the Graph

This visualization shows:

- **Red Nodes**: Recipes
- **Green Nodes**: Ingredients  
- **Blue Nodes**: Regions

## Controls

Use the filter controls above the graph to:
- Filter by region (China, Colombia, Peru)
- Filter by ingredient category
- Search for specific nodes

## Data Source

Graph data is generated from the [generate_graph.py](https://github.com/iberi22/gastronomic-open-standard-GOS/blob/main/scripts/generate_graph.py) script.
